{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 48,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 412.61,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that, as soon as Amalickiah had obtained the kingdom",
      "verse": "48:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.685,
      "end": 9.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he began to inspire the hearts of the Lamanites against the people of Nephi;",
      "verse": "48:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.463,
      "end": 15.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he did appoint men to speak unto the Lamanites from their towers, against the Nephites.",
      "verse": "48:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 16.273,
      "end": 19.71,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus he did inspire their hearts against the Nephites,",
      "verse": "48:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 19.89,
      "end": 24.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that in the latter end of the nineteenth year of the reign of the judges,",
      "verse": "48:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 25.086,
      "end": 27.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he having accomplished his designs thus far,",
      "verse": "48:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 27.913,
      "end": 31.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, having been made king over the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "48:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 31.344,
      "end": 34.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he sought also to reign over all the land,",
      "verse": "48:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 34.403,
      "end": 37.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and all the people who were in the land,",
      "verse": "48:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.323,
      "end": 39.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Nephites as well as the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "48:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 40.325,
      "end": 42.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore he had accomplished his design,",
      "verse": "48:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 43.059,
      "end": 46.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he had hardened the hearts of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "48:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 46.722,
      "end": 48.347,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and blinded their minds,",
      "verse": "48:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 48.527,
      "end": 55.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stirred them up to anger, insomuch that he had gathered together a numerous host to go to battle against the Nephites.",
      "verse": "48:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 56.405,
      "end": 63.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he was determined, because of the greatness of the number of his people, to overpower the Nephites",
      "verse": "48:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 63.551,
      "end": 65.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to bring them into bondage.",
      "verse": "48:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 66.553,
      "end": 70.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus he did appoint chief captains of the Zoramites,",
      "verse": "48:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 70.262,
      "end": 73.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they being the most acquainted with the strength of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "48:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 74.064,
      "end": 76.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their places of resort,",
      "verse": "48:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 76.38,
      "end": 78.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the weakest parts of their cities;",
      "verse": "48:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 79.021,
      "end": 83.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he appointed them to be chief captains over his armies.",
      "verse": "48:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 83.881,
      "end": 87.271,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they took their camp,",
      "verse": "48:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 87.451,
      "end": 91.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and moved forth toward the land of Zarahemla in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "48:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 92.311,
      "end": 98.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that while Amalickiah had thus been obtaining power by fraud and deceit,",
      "verse": "48:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 99.178,
      "end": 103.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Moroni, on the other hand, had been preparing the minds of the people",
      "verse": "48:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 103.816,
      "end": 106.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be faithful unto the Lord their God.",
      "verse": "48:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 106.725,
      "end": 109.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, he had been strengthening the armies of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "48:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 110.063,
      "end": 117.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and erecting small forts, or places of resort; throwing up banks of earth round about to enclose his armies,",
      "verse": "48:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 118.045,
      "end": 125.383,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also building walls of stone to encircle them about, round about their cities and the borders of their lands;",
      "verse": "48:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 125.563,
      "end": 127.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all round about the land.",
      "verse": "48:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 128.472,
      "end": 133.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in their weakest fortifications he did place the greater number of men;",
      "verse": "48:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 133.575,
      "end": 136.826,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus he did fortify and strengthen the land",
      "verse": "48:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 137.006,
      "end": 139.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was possessed by the Nephites.",
      "verse": "48:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 139.962,
      "end": 143.073,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus he was preparing to support their liberty,",
      "verse": "48:10",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 143.253,
      "end": 147.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their lands, their wives, and their children, and their peace,",
      "verse": "48:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 147.334,
      "end": 150.306,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they might live unto the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "48:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 150.486,
      "end": 155.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they might maintain that which was called by their enemies",
      "verse": "48:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 155.821,
      "end": 157.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the cause of Christians.",
      "verse": "48:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 158.312,
      "end": 161.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Moroni was a strong and a mighty man;",
      "verse": "48:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 161.325,
      "end": 164.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was a man of a perfect understanding;",
      "verse": "48:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 164.245,
      "end": 167.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a man that did not delight in bloodshed;",
      "verse": "48:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 167.536,
      "end": 170.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a man whose soul did joy in the liberty",
      "verse": "48:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 170.456,
      "end": 172.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the freedom of his country,",
      "verse": "48:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 172.912,
      "end": 175.513,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his brethren from bondage and slavery;",
      "verse": "48:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 176.193,
      "end": 180.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, a man whose heart did swell with thanksgiving to his God,",
      "verse": "48:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 180.32,
      "end": 185.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the many privileges and blessings which he bestowed upon his people;",
      "verse": "48:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 185.562,
      "end": 189.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a man who did labor exceedingly for the welfare and safety of his people.",
      "verse": "48:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 190.468,
      "end": 194.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and he was a man who was firm in the faith of Christ,",
      "verse": "48:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 194.363,
      "end": 199.193,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he had sworn with an oath to defend his people, his rights, and his country,",
      "verse": "48:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 199.373,
      "end": 202.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his religion, even to the loss of his blood.",
      "verse": "48:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 203.072,
      "end": 206.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Nephites were taught to defend themselves against their enemies,",
      "verse": "48:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 206.967,
      "end": 210.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even to the shedding of blood if it were necessary;",
      "verse": "48:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 210.398,
      "end": 213.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they were also taught never to give an offense,",
      "verse": "48:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 214.154,
      "end": 216.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and never to raise the sword",
      "verse": "48:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 216.935,
      "end": 219.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were against an enemy,",
      "verse": "48:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 219.576,
      "end": 221.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were to preserve their lives.",
      "verse": "48:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 222.578,
      "end": 224.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this was their faith,",
      "verse": "48:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 224.383,
      "end": 232.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that by so doing God would prosper them in the land, or in other words, if they were faithful in keeping the commandments of God",
      "verse": "48:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 233.062,
      "end": 235.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would prosper them in the land;",
      "verse": "48:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 235.75,
      "end": 240.905,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, warn them to flee, or to prepare for war, according to their danger;",
      "verse": "48:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 241.585,
      "end": 244.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also, that God would make it known unto them",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 245.062,
      "end": 249.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whither they should go to defend themselves against their enemies,",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 249.329,
      "end": 252.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by so doing, the Lord would deliver them;",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 252.342,
      "end": 254.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this was the faith of Moroni,",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 254.844,
      "end": 256.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his heart did glory in it;",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 257.021,
      "end": 258.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not in the shedding of blood",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 259.012,
      "end": 261.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but in doing good, in preserving his people,",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 261.7,
      "end": 264.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in keeping the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 264.388,
      "end": 266.571,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and resisting iniquity.",
      "verse": "48:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 267.251,
      "end": 271.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, verily, verily I say unto you, if all men had been, and were,",
      "verse": "48:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 272.168,
      "end": 274.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ever would be, like unto Moroni,",
      "verse": "48:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 274.856,
      "end": 278.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the very powers of hell would have been shaken forever;",
      "verse": "48:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 279.123,
      "end": 284.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, the devil would never have power over the hearts of the children of men.",
      "verse": "48:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 285.329,
      "end": 288.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he was a man like unto Ammon, the son of Mosiah,",
      "verse": "48:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 289.131,
      "end": 291.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and even the other sons of Mosiah,",
      "verse": "48:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 292.005,
      "end": 294.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also Alma and his sons,",
      "verse": "48:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 294.6,
      "end": 296.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were all men of God.",
      "verse": "48:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 297.23,
      "end": 299.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, Helaman and his brethren",
      "verse": "48:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 299.918,
      "end": 303.633,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were no less serviceable unto the people than was Moroni;",
      "verse": "48:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 303.813,
      "end": 306.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they did preach the word of God,",
      "verse": "48:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 306.408,
      "end": 309.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did baptize unto repentance all men",
      "verse": "48:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 309.56,
      "end": 311.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whosoever would hearken unto their words.",
      "verse": "48:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 312.655,
      "end": 314.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they went forth,",
      "verse": "48:20",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 314.646,
      "end": 321.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the people did humble themselves because of their words, insomuch that they were highly favored of the Lord,",
      "verse": "48:20",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 321.792,
      "end": 329.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they were free from wars and contentions among themselves, yea, even for the space of four years.",
      "verse": "48:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 330.274,
      "end": 335.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, as I have said, in the latter end of the nineteenth year, yea,",
      "verse": "48:21",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 335.98,
      "end": 338.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding their peace amongst themselves,",
      "verse": "48:21",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 339.132,
      "end": 344.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were compelled reluctantly to contend with their brethren, the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "48:21",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 344.688,
      "end": 351.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and in fine, their wars never did cease for the space of many years with the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "48:22",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 351.462,
      "end": 353.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding their much reluctance.",
      "verse": "48:22",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 354.603,
      "end": 358.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, they were sorry to take up arms against the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "48:23",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 358.266,
      "end": 361.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they did not delight in the shedding of blood;",
      "verse": "48:23",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 361.697,
      "end": 363.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and this was not all\u2014",
      "verse": "48:23",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 363.642,
      "end": 368.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were sorry to be the means of sending so many of their brethren",
      "verse": "48:23",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 368.187,
      "end": 372.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "out of this world into an eternal world, unprepared to meet their God.",
      "verse": "48:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 373.372,
      "end": 385.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, they could not suffer to lay down their lives, that their wives and their children should be massacred by the barbarous cruelty of those who were once their brethren,",
      "verse": "48:24",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 385.255,
      "end": 387.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and had dissented from their church,",
      "verse": "48:24",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 387.989,
      "end": 389.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had left them",
      "verse": "48:24",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 389.702,
      "end": 393.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had gone to destroy them by joining the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "48:24",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 393.911,
      "end": 395.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they could not bear",
      "verse": "48:25",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 395.716,
      "end": 400.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that their brethren should rejoice over the blood of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "48:25",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 400.865,
      "end": 404.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so long as there were any who should keep the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "48:25",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 404.992,
      "end": 407.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the promise of the Lord was,",
      "verse": "48:25",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 407.448,
      "end": 409.724,
      "type": "line",
